# Who owns what.
#
# DOCUMENTATION AND A REVIEWER HINT — NOT A MERGE GATE.
#
# This file is deliberately NOT wired to `require_code_owner_reviews`. GitHub
# forbids a pull request author approving their own, and @sadakc is the only
# owner: a path rule on supabase/ would make our own migration PRs require his
# approval *and* be unapprovable by him. Permanently unmergeable, with no admin
# bypass now that enforce_admins is on.
#
# Lovable's changes are gated instead by commit authorship, in the `lovable-gate`
# CI job. See docs/operations/REVIEWING_LOVABLE_CHANGES.md.
#
# If a second maintainer ever joins, wiring this up becomes viable — and worth
# revisiting.

# Everything, by default.
*                           @sadakc

# Schema. Changes here are irreversible in a way application code is not.
/supabase/                  @sadakc

# The checks, and the scripts they run. Must not be edited by what they check.
/.github/                   @sadakc
/scripts/                   @sadakc

# Shared services every module depends on.
/src/platform/              @sadakc

# The only file outside a module that may name one.
/src/modules/registry.ts    @sadakc

# The rules themselves.
/AGENTS.md                  @sadakc
/docs/standards/            @sadakc
